OL,3,AMusk's SpaceX to build $100bn launch
OL,4,Afacility in Louisiana
OL,5,
OL,6,FMulti-billionaire Elon Musk's rocket
OL,7,Fcompany SpaceX has announced that it
OL,8,Fwill build its largest launch site yet
OL,9,Fin the southern US state of Louisiana.
OL,11,FConstruction of the $100bn (#73bn)
OL,12,Fproject - named Starbase, Louisiana -
OL,13,Fis due to start next year, with the
OL,14,F125,000-acre (50,585-hectare) site
OL,15,Fexpanding on the company's operations
OL,16,Fbeyond its current Texas headquarters
OL,17,Fand locations in Florida.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,117,105,200,300,0,100
