OL,3,AMusk's SpaceX to build $100bn launch
OL,4,Afacility in Louisiana
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt will be used to "support thousands
OL,7,Fof Starship flights a year with
OL,8,Fmissions launching to Earth orbit, the
OL,9,FMoon, Mars and beyond," SpaceX said on
OL,10,FTuesday.
OL,12,FIn June, SpaceX shares started trading
OL,13,Fon New York's technology-focused Nasdaq
OL,14,Fin the world's biggest ever stock
OL,15,Fmarket debut.
